2. **Per-Item I/O in Loop (N+1 Queries):** Executing `await db.query(...)` per element incurs a network round-trip per user ID.
3. **Unbounded Input & Wildcard Projection:** `userIds` has no upper bound, risking parameter limit exhaustion or excessive memory allocation.

### Fix
